    "description": {
      "value": "Your target's mind tumbles down a deep well of dread, dwelling so intently on deep-seated fears that it's painful. The target takes 4d6 mental damage with a Will saving throw.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage and becomes frightened 1.\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage and becomes frightened 2.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes double damage and becomes frightened 3."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): Increase the damage by 2d6."
